#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:1
msgid "E4182"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `regex_constant_ref_in_lex_is_not_supported`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:5
msgid ""
"This diagnostic described a restriction of an earlier lexical pattern "
"form and is not emitted by the current compiler."
msgstr "この診断は以前の字句パターン形式の制限を説明するものであり、現在のコンパイラでは発生しません。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:8
msgid ""
"Current `lexmatch` and `lexscan` cases accept regex constant expressions,"
" including named `const` values."
msgstr "現在の `lexmatch` と `lexscan` のケースは、名前付き `const` 値を含む正規表現の定数式を受け付けます。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:11
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:13
msgid "The following historical example uses the old pattern shape:"
msgstr "次の過去の例では、古いパターン形式を使っています："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"const WORD = re\"[A-Za-z]+\"\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_word(input : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    (WORD, _) => ()\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:19
msgid "Current code should use the regex constant as the case pattern instead."
msgstr "現在のコードでは、代わりに正規表現定数をケースパターンとして使います。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:21
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:23
msgid "Use the regex constant directly as the case pattern:"
msgstr "正規表現定数をケースパターンとして直接使ってください："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4182.md:25
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"const WORD = re\"^[A-Za-z]+$\"\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_word(input : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    WORD => ()\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
